Package: FastHer
Title: Fast Local Heritability Estimation from GWAS Summary Statistics
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gulnara", "Svishcheva", email = "gulsvi@mail.ru", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates local SNP heritability and a model-data concordance
    parameter from GWAS summary statistics (z-statistics) and a linkage
    disequilibrium (LD) matrix by exact restricted maximum likelihood (REML).
    The LD matrix is eigen-decomposed once, after which each REML iteration
    is cheap. Supports SNP weights computed from allele frequencies, a Wald
    test for model-data concordance, and regularization of reference LD
    matrices by adaptive eigenvalue truncation.
